  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening Indonesia&apos;s Regulatory Sandbox for Digital Health Innovation (DHI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strengthening Regulatory Sandbox for Digital Health Innovations project aims to enhance the Ministry of Health&apos;s (MoH) capacity to independently manage and oversee the Regulatory Sandbox (RegSand) for digital health innovations. The project also aims to address inclusivity in digital health by developing inclusivity evaluation guidelines and an inclusive design toolkit for innovators, and facilitating workshops to disseminate these documents. This initiative will establish standards to guide the design of digital health solutions that are accessible, user-centered, and ethically created for diverse populations, including vulnerable groups</narrative>
  </description>
